# EcoSetu Mobile — Environment Configuration Template
# Canonical Reference: docs/15_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md Section 2.3, docs/09_FRONTEND_ARCHITECTURE.md
#
# Usage:
# Copy this file to `mobile/.env` for your local or build configuration.
# The mobile client dynamically resolves the base API URL without requiring manual code changes.

# Local Development URL:
# - For Android Emulator: 10.0.2.2 maps to host machine localhost:3001
API_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:3001/api/v1

# - For Physical Device on local Wi-Fi, set LAN IP:
# API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.100:3001/api/v1

# Production Deployment URL (When building release APK against deployed Google Cloud Run backend):
# Do NOT hardcode fake domains. Set to your real deployed Google Cloud Run service URL ONLY after deployment:
# PRODUCTION_API_BASE_URL=https://ecosetu-backend-CHANGE_ME-uc.a.run.app/api/v1

# Default Geolocation Coordinates (New Delhi, India)
DEFAULT_MAP_LAT=28.6139
DEFAULT_MAP_LNG=77.2090
